<title>TUNISIA: Tunisia's BNA bank H1 profit 8.7 mln dnr.</title>
<headline>Tunisia's BNA bank H1 profit 8.7 mln dnr.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisia's Banque Nationale Agricole (BNA) on Tuesday said its net profits for the first half of 1996 amounted to 8.766 million dinars.</p>
<p>Profits for the same period last year were not available for comparison. They were 14.693 million dinars for the whole of 1995.</p>
<p>BNA, a state-controlled bank, has a capital of 100 million dinars.</p>
<p>BNA's shares were last priced 31.67 dinars at the Tunis Stock Exchange. ($=0.97 dinar)</p>
